Woh sham

Woh sham-e-december behad khubsurat thi 
Do pal ke liye h sahi badli humne apni kahani thi 
Ye mulaqat beshak hamari pehli thi 
Par iss sham ke baad meri khushiyan kuch  nayi thi,
Ki jaise jeeti maine ek jung purani thi.
Khambhat iss waqt ko jane kis baat ki jaldi thi ?
Aj bhi lagta aisa hai ki,
Batte abhi bahut si baki thi.
Woh sham-e-december behad khubsurat thi.